{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"63154730dda5dc62a406abb86a87e35d98538b23af533a42bbbd1923c22abd7c","occurred_at":"2026-11-21T21:47:37Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The dependency scan already enumerates systemd [Unit] dependency directives, but omits `PropagatesStopTo=` and its inverse `StopPropagatedFrom=`. Those directives can make stopping a co-installed unit stop the selected crq unit, so a scan that does not recognize them can miss a live-binding hazard and report support incorrectly. Adding both names to the existing alternation is a routine correctness repair, not a new requirement.","target":"33d2d0a7e18fc0cab58a1408214c866ba2ff092e"},"finding_id":"1d6d3a879edaf2afe7e9a329fb5916c084c5d2f4f230f484983ff91ea4a44881","previous_event_id":"2faba2a64a8ab1585efa7268157adffdee0cfc9504337babe1bedd550fb4b287","review_id":"9a9770d007f4898ae9f169624c7b761856e1e349d118670986a85a8250d506cd"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:1d6d3a879edaf2afe7e9a329fb5916c084c5d2f4f230f484983ff91ea4a44881:4e79c4bb0c1b04b235e9920704fab5bd34cc3000ca04ccc5d4994350a1472c57"}